<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Final SAfrica 1996 wheat estimate 2.700 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Final SAfrica 1996 wheat estimate 2.700 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's National Crop Estimate's Committee on Monday said it had revised downwards the final 1996 wheat production figure to 2.700 million tonnes from 2.753 million in January.  </p>
<p>The committee said the estimate for the 1996 barley crop was unchanged from a month ago at 176,000 tonnes, with oats also steady at 33,330 tonnes.</p>
<p>The rye estimate remained unchanged at 3,366 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
